WEBVTT

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.500
I am the hero chosen by fate...

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.340
The Shining Crusader...

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.420
Alicia Edelcia!

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:18.760
Oww! What!?

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.640
Don't stab the sword in hard ground!

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.310
We just bought it!

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.480
Erk... Sorry!

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.440
Ack, the blade's dinged up...

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.900
Hell Shredder Zwei...

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.110
Ah geez, he liked it enough to name it...

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.610
I'm super sorry, Edgar!

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.490
There you have it — the legendary hero party.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.620
She's kowtowing...!!

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.950
I never wanted to see a hero kowtow!

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.660
You guys have been heroes this whole time?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.370
Even back at Winter Thanksgiving?

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.420
No... In fact, we've only been adventuring for like six months now...

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.090
What? They're that green!?

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.550
They're totally rookies!

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.380
How did they become heroes...?

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:56.930
Excuse me, may I?

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.680
Icuras Elran.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:07.150
They repelled an army of goblins and other monsters! Who were they!?

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:11.400
They subjugated a menace that threatened the whole kingdom. Who were they!?

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.190
Yes! Praise it!

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.660
Praise the birth of the legendary hero!!

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:20.450
What happened back then...

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.790
None of us remember...

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:25.830
Lady hero! Bless us with your words!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.460
Huh? Uhh...

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.090
May all be as God guides it!

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.250
She said it! Yes!

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.880
Alicia's party got all the credit for that army of monsters you slew before...

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:39.590
Gotta say, this picture-in-picture thing is kinda jarring, though.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.010
Ah, now I get it.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.430
What is this spell?

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.980
Hey, um...

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.480
Kuroki...

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:58.110
You reconstructed the Luvaldram Barrier before...

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.330
(Alicia Arc — The End)

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.660
Wait... No.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:04.370
That totally wasn't you, right?

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.790
I know all about making too much of a name for yourself.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.880
I can keep it a secret...!

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:17.170
That's how I ended up working with the holy hero, Alicia, and her party for a bit.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.510
There it is!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.390
The Labyrinth of Deep Darkness...

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:22.680
The promise we made back when we were kids...

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:25.310
Is this dungeon really that exciting to you guys?

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:33.440
Sure. Once I got the hero title, the Adventurers' Guild granted us permission to explore this highly difficult A-rank dungeon...

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.190
Hold on, let me see.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.070
Icuras Elran.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.320
My sparkly waaand...

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.910
Alicia, don't cry!!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.620
We'll give you the legendary "Wand of Salvation" one day!

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.160
Yeah! When we grow up...

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.660
Let's go to the Labyrinth of Deep Darkness!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.210
Yeeeee! Waaah! They're so cuuute!!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.250
Shut. Up.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.380
Ah! Ow!?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.510
That hurt!

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:00.130
I-I'm supposed to be the big sister of the group!!

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.600
You two used to follow me around like a pair of ducklings!!

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.560
Yeah, because you were a walking disaster and someone had to keep an eye on you...

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.930
Walking off cliffs and strolling into forests filled with brown bears...

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.020
I can't count how many times you would be dead if we weren't saving you!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.360
Huuuh!?

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.770
Now I get it...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.410
- Hold up.
- What is it?

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:27.290
Bahamalion Sladrach.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.670
Regsuuld Stagga.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.590
Stagga Magna.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:41.300
Ooh...!

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.770
Ah, is that it?

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.650
This route must've been a quick way back to the entrance once you reached the end.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.490
Well, hey. You got it.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.200
Right...

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.280
Oh, yeah...

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.780
Go team...

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.200
Sorry...

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.080
Icuras Cuora.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:14.920
Huh...?

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.880
Wha...?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.420
May I ask why?

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.180
Icuras Cuora.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.470
Rgh!

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.720
What the hell, Uncle!?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.390
Seriously, what the hell was that!?

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:34.730
Look, I wanted them to go through the dungeon and earn the wand properly.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:39.110
What I did was the equivalent of using a cheat code to skip straight to the ending.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.690
He's dragging them!!

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:45.610
And so... The group and I cleared the dungeon normally...

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.040
It's the Wand of Salvation!

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.750
That was nice.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.920
I thought it was gonna be way worse when I saw their memories erased.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.630
Wh... Now hold on!

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.930
Why would you erase it again!?

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:12.970
Well... It felt to me like the true ending for them would be if they cleared the dungeon on their own, without my help.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.690
So I was going to erase my involvement from their memories.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.150
It's so pretty...

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.240
Thank you, everyone...!

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.700
Edgar...

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.160
Raiga...

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:29.950
Kuroki.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.370
The four of us spent this day together...

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:40.790
And I'm sure... I'll never forget it.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.550
Yeah, for sure.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.840
Mm. It was an adventure, huh?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.140
Okay, then...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.020
Hey, where are you going?

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.440
The capital. Some business there just came up.

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:58.560
What?

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:00.980
But we haven't claimed the bounty for slaying the Stabber Beast yet...

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.650
You can pay me later.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.030
Huh? "Later"...?

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.820
Well, um, at least take these!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.160
Healing spell-cards...!?

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.620
Consider it your share!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.750
Yeah, okay. I could use them.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:22.960
Thanks.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:28.840
Heh...

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.930
Anyway, you get the idea.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.180
That was... actually kinda cool.

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.140
You were cool as ice there, Uncle.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:45.690
You gotta keep a cool head when dangerous battles are your profession.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:50.360
I learned that from Shinrei Jusatsushi Taroumaru.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:51.740
There it is...!!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:54.160
If it wasn't for this part...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.950
Isn't it kinda hot today?

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.330
The sun's really bright.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.290
You think?

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:07.380
Being in a room with no AC during the summer sure is like a blast from the past.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:12.340
Hm? You didn't even get fans in middle and high school classrooms, right?

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:16.140
What? Every classroom's got one these days.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:19.270
(This varies by region.)

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:17.100
Right?

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.980
- Yeah.
- Really!?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.140
Back in my day...

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.980
Oh, just, you don't say things like "back in my day" very often.

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:28.110
I hear they had corporal punishment and stuff back in your day...

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.700
There'd always be a kid getting a hard paddling.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:31.780
That bad, huh?

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:37.080
Well, these days, they don't touch you, but they still give you nasty verbal abuse.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.710
Let's move on from that god-awful topic!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.880
I wanna know what happened after you headed for the capital!

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:45.630
Oh, really? Sure.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.590
Icuras Elran.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.010
Heck yeah!

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:52.430
Are escapist fantasies a coping mechanism for Takafumi!?

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:56.180
He's had it rough in middle school year three when his parents got divorced...

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:02.890
Grr! Vile orc! Y... You'll get nothing from me!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.650
I wasn't asking you.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.230
Icuras Sladrach.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:12.280
Captain!?

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.490
I see.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.410
So it's the Church that's authorized to declare heroes.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:22.210
The main nominator was Prelate Zernegan.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:26.670
Ooh, and he's having a clandestine meeting with the commander-in-chief of the army right now?

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.880
Damn you!

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.260
Thanks for the tip.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:34.970
Wargrent Sladseld.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.310
He's gone!?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.350
What did you come to the capital to do?

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.940
It was about Alicia's group.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:52.030
They got granted a title way beyond their abilities.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.740
It was worrying.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:59.490
Allow me to express my deepest gratitude for your generosity.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.250
Our mounting cathedral construction expenses are a pressing matter...

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.160
But...

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.080
Once there is a crisis...

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.040
Our demands for an increase in military spending will be acceded to.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.590
A crisis sufficient to kill a hero...

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:15.630
I heard they got permission to clear a dangerous dungeon...

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:18.260
I expected them to make themselves useful...

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.550
So that's what's going on.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.260
Rgh... Who are you!?

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:27.140
Aggravating a national crisis, then lining your pockets with the extra military income...

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.480
That's what you were using those three for...

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.270
Unhand him!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:32.650
Icuras Elran.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:37.070
Is that, me?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:39.450
It is presently proceeding on the path at the foot of Mount Dold.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.660
Three adventurers seem to be heading there to stop it.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.910
Adventurers?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.200
Y... Yes.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:49.000
If I may, those adventurers are just rookies...

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:54.800
Give the adventurers an assignment to slay ten goblins.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:01.220
So you were using them as disposable pawns even then.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:06.180
They knew the risks when they signed up to be adventurers.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.900
I gave them what they signed up for. What's wrong with that?

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.150
This jerk's actually defending himself!

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:17.360
Yes, they knew adventuring was a risky profession.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:21.990
And after surviving that experience, he was trying to have them killed again.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:26.040
It's an offense to the spirits of people who risked their lives and died for it.

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.660
That's not remotely okay.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.290
Oh... Oh my god.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.750
It's...

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:35.510
The superior modern values trope!

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:39.010
Those uppity otherworld natives with medieval views on human rights...

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:43.180
You smack down and crush them with modern societal values as a cudgel.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:47.600
That... That's a guy worth smacking down...!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.600
"What's wrong with that," you ask...?

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:51.520
Well... Uh... I mean...

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.190
You can't... do that...

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:53.650
Uncle!?

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:58.070
It's like if a young twenty-something person who's never worked even part-time...

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:02.110
Got, like... suddenly smacked by some corporate big-shot in like, upper management or something...

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.700
- Commander!
- Foul orc!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:06.200
Save him!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.910
Seize him.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.540
Zaktola Catolph.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:17.250
Is it...

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:18.340
- Transformation magic!?
- Get back!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.260
I was in a pretty tight spot there...

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:25.220
So I got out of it by transforming into the most powerful creature I knew.

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:28.560
The most powerful...? What could it be....!?

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.070
- Uh...
- Who...?

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:41.570
- Uh...
- Who...?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.370
Don't panic. He's just a rare species of orc, nothing mo—

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.500
Uh, seriously... Who is this...?

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:01.470
It's Tabuchi-sensei. My year two middle school homeroom teacher.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:02.840
Never heard of him...!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.550
Tabuchi-sensei is seriously powerful in debates...

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.720
He's a terrifying monster, but I called upon his strength...

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.230
Did you just—

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.440
Hey— Knock it o—

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:19.900
Yes, sir.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.690
See that? Totally out-debated.

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:22.610
Out-debated?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.700
Please just stop!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.200
Yes, the commander made a coldhearted decision!!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.240
However, eleven years ago...

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.160
There was a village...

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.000
Greyler, don't...

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.210
That village, my hometown, was destroyed by a massive goblin legion...

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.010
Yes, sir.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:44.260
As you can see, he shut their arguments down 100%.

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.010
This dude's overpowered in debates...!!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:48.470
So this is the power of a '90s teacher...!!

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:50.260
Are you satisfied?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:54.100
Look... Our military budget as it is won't defend the kingdom against threats.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:57.770
Ever since the Venom Dragon slaying three years ago...

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.030
Extraordinary things have been happening all over the continent...

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:05.650
The Blaze Dragon was slain... Someone attempted to destroy the Luvaldram Barrier...

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.740
Leading to the mass movement of a goblin legion this time...!!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:12.500
Someone is operating from the shadows, working to undermine the natural order of our world!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.410
It's you...

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.040
This all started because of you, Uncle...!!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:18.330
Yes, it's true.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.500
Even with Tabuchi-sensei's thought patterns...

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.210
I couldn't bring myself to smack him after that...

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.340
Ooh...!

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.010
It's her!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.470
The legend's guardian and wielder both!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:35.520
The God-Freezing Sleeping Beauty! Mabel Rayveil-dono!

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.810
Suffocate by my icy blade and go to sleep...

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.950
Go away!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.410
Oh... Sorry to pause there. Let's keep going.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.580
Sure thing.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.880
Raybelio Yuul Elran!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:08.260
Raybelio Yuul Elran.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:27.240
- So fast!
- Get him, Mabel-dono!

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.570
Go, Guardian Knight-dono!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.120
Even after they became friends...

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.160
That's the realness of the otherworld...!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.960
Uh, not exactly. We're over there.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.790
- Got you now, Mabel!
- Wooolf!

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.040
What!? Then what's the fight!?

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.090
It's a spell that creates illusions from ice.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:50.380
When I saw what Mabel was going for, I mimicked it on the spot.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.600
Wild Talker is seriously no joke.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:57.060
What are you doing here?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.440
I've become a knight of the kingdom.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.560
Ooh..! Good for you!

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:05.690
I get a salary and full benefits.

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:08.150
Turns out adventuring is for chumps. Total chumps.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:14.070
What was I doing wasting all that time worrying about my future?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:18.000
You should make your way up the ladder to where I am, Wolf-kun.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:18.660
I'll be right here waiting!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:19.750
She's ego-tripping...!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:22.710
The NEET got a job and now she's on a complete ego trip...!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.790
Say, uh... How did you get it, Mabel-san?

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:26.300
Why are you calling her "-san" now?

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:29.470
Oh, I was sleeping out in the open with this Beast Robe...

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.550
Some royal knights out on patrol tried to hunt me...

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:36.720
I turned the hunt back around on them with my sword, and they were so impressed that they hired me on the spot.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:40.230
Getting in the same way might be a teensy bit difficult for you, Wolf-kun.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.690
- Yikes...
- Wow...

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.440
So... What do we do about...

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:48.320
Easy! I win the fight, then you change your ways and decide to work for me.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.780
I'll get a pay raise, and you'll get a knighthood.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.070
You want me to throw a fight?

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.870
N-No, I mean... It's just a visual representation, a game, really...

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.410
A game? That's even more of a reason to take it seriously.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.420
You've got two losses on your record.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.420
Come on...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.880
Why do you want to beat me so badly...?

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:15.260
We... We spent a night sharing a bed together!

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:18.560
Don't you think Mabel-chan's at least a little cute!?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.640
Of course you're cute, Mabel.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.940
Now I get it.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.150
But... How did you see through my illusions?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.610
How could we not?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:36.780
I never imagined you were infiltrating our ranks as a spy for the dark orc...!!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.030
What...? No...! That's not...

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.580
All right. Fine. In that case...

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:44.210
Give me one good reason why a member of the illustrious Ice Clan would be sleeping out in the open like a pauper!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.290
Rgh... Urrrgh...

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.500
Goodbye, job...!!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.210
You can't can you?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.010
- What's she doing!?
- Turning on her friend!?

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:09.820
Raffald!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.530
What the hell are you doing!?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.900
Commander! Please, stay back!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.660
Kurochelgid Riolran.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:35.420
What... was I just...?

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:38.760
Magic that governs the souls and bodies of living things is...

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.220
Holy magic...!

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:44.600
It was you, Prelate! You were using holy magic to impose your will on Mabel's soul and control her!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:48.400
Rgh... You actually severed my high-level mind-spurring control magic...

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.110
You really are a dark orc...!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:53.230
What were you going to do once you had Mabel under your control!?

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.490
What else? Kill you to silence you for—

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.860
You were going to do something lewd, weren't you!?

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:02.860
You want to get a girl bound and helpless, then lick her cheek...!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.370
- Huh?
- What?

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:06.540
His idea of lewd is so outdated...!!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.290
Hey, stay with me!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.540
Is that a healing spell-card...!?

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:16.090
Commander. Is this dirty old man really the guy you want to work with...?

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:19.130
No! In these times when monsters run rampant...

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:24.140
I get that you're willing to get your hands dirty to safeguard your land.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.930
But does it really have to be your first resort?

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:33.610
You're blessed with all these people who look up to you. Don't you trust in their abilities?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:39.780
Commander! L-Let's just call it off!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.950
I agree! Let's call it off!

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.950
It's been hard watching you lately, commander!

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:46.500
You've been clearly brooding since around the time the hero got named!!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.710
- It's very out of character for you, sir!
- Way out of character!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.460
You guys...!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:57.710
But... I set them up to die, I committed myself to heartlessness...!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.430
Even if they did survive... It's too late...

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.140
It's not too late at all, sir!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.640
Let's change course and turn back, commander!!

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:17.400
Yes, sir.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.360
- Hooray!!
- Commander!

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:23.120
- That educational experience...!!
- What an educational experience...!!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.530
Y-You can't!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.870
How will you protect the country without a budget!?

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.790
I'll help with that.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:32.210
If a threat shows up, shout my name into the void.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.210
The spirits will make sure I hear it.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.210
My name is...

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.750
Wait.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.720
I'm Ricardo Markfeld.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.930
I'm Kamegashira Mansaku.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.470
Wolfgunblood?

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.060
I'm Wolfgunblood.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:50.430
That was close...!!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.810
He was about to make them shout a ridiculous name into the void...

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:54.980
Grr...

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:58.030
You're losing your touch, commander...

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.900
What can one lousy orc do anyway?

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:02.150
Zaktola Catolph.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:08.040
Another transformation!? Your petty bluffs won't help you with me!!

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.790
The Blaze Dragon...?

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:21.220
Commander Markfeld.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:24.550
If you see those three, apologize to them personally.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.600
They'll probably forgive you.

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.360
Mega-dragon-shifting magic...

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.660
Wow, Uncle!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.870
That was incredible!

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.950
"Don't you trust in your companions?" That was sick!

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.000
Oh...

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.710
It's important to let the Undead Hero rampage and pop Parasite Bombs when you need help.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.290
Of course he learned it from video games.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.630
You should always remember you have allies to turn to...!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.170
Well...

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.590
At least that wrapped up nice and neatly...

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.630
(Notice of Dismissal)

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:07.550
Mabel-san...

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.770
The memory spirit even translates the on-screen text...

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.520
It's like an anime aired overseas.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.980
Ooh, that's a nice breeze.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.900
Is it just me, or is it still way too bright out?

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:20.820
Huh?

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.570
Takafumi?

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.030
Whoa...

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:26.820
Hey...! What the heck...!?

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:30.330
Hmm... That's magic.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:32.330
Did you do anything to cause this?

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:34.250
Huh? I mean...

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:38.330
I borrowed magic from you at the college campus...

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.920
Oh yeah!

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:43.170
I can pull off shortened spell incantations!

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.670
That lets you ki—

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:46.090
Subdue opponents way more efficiently...

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.680
That's it.

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:53.220
If you start making high-handed demands like, "and make it quick, thanks, bye," the first day you meet the spirits...

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.890
Of course they won't take kindly to that.

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:57.850
The wind spirit blows air...

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:00.480
The light spirit makes it bright...

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:04.360
The form spirit changes you into a draco-human...

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:07.070
The form spirit seems kind of excessive, don't you think!?

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:08.950
I've got this, Fujimiya-san.

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.660
Zaktola Catolph.

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:53.750
The shadow stretches further and further with a goodbye.

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:57.470
Why do you never notice it?

00:22:57.470 --> 00:23:03.560
I've been looking towards you all this time.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:15.650
All these personal feelings looking for a place to go​.

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:21.820
A brush of orange gently ​painted the sky.

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:30.160
Let it ring! ​The wish upon those tiny stars.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:36.710
Yearning to light up the sky far, far away.

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:41.340
Wanting to get it through, but not getting through.

00:23:41.340 --> 00:23:45.100
Turning this feeling of love.

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:48.810
Into an everlasting star.

00:23:48.810 --> 00:23:53.610
Shining only for you​.
